    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nOPEN VIEWING SATURDAY 03RD OCTOBER 2026 - 11AM TO 11.30AM\n\nSherry FitzGerald are delighted to present 59 Boroimhe Alder to the market, a beautifully maintained mid-terrace home ideally positioned in a quiet and mature residential setting within the ever-popular Boroimhe development.\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, this bright and spacious property offers well-proportioned accommodation comprising entrance hall, guest Wc, open plan lounge, and modern kitchen/dining area on the ground floor. Upstairs, there are two generous double bedrooms and a family bathroom.\n\nA particular feature of this home is its attractive outlook overlooking Forest Little Golf Club, providing a peaceful open aspect and an added sense of privacy rarely found in such a convenient location.\n\nTo the rear, the property enjoys a private, low-maintenance garden ideal for outdoor dining and relaxation. To the front, there is off-street parking and an attractive approach to the home.\n\nBoroimhe is one of Swords' most sought-after residential developments, with a wealth of amenities on its doorstep, including Boroimhe Shopping Centre, schools, parks, cafés and sports facilities. Swords Village, the Pavilions Shopping Centre, Airside Retail Park and Dublin Airport are all within easy reach. \n\nThe area is exceptionally well connected by public and private transport links, including the Swords Express, while the M1 and M50 motorways provide convenient access to Dublin City Centre and beyond.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and is by appointment only through the sole selling agent, Sherry FitzGerald."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch - 1.3m x 0.9m\nWood flooring.\n\nLounge - 4.2m x 5.6m\nBright and spacious lounge with feature open fireplace, understairs storage, and wood flooring.\n\nGuest Wc - 1.3m x 1.9m\nLarge guest bathroom comprising Wc, wash hand basin, recessed spotlights. Tiled flooring.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 4.1m x 4.1m\nModern shaker fitted kitchen with a range of wall and floor units, worktops, tiled splashback, built-in oven, hob and extractor fan. Tiled flooring. Double doors lead to the private rear garden.\n\nUPSTAIRS - \n\n\nLanding - 2.1m x 3.9m\nBuilt-in wardrobe providing excellent storage. Carpet flooring. Access to the attic room.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.2m x 3.9m\nSpacious double bedroom with built-in wardrobes and carpet flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.1m x 3.4m\nGenerous double bedroom with built-in wardrobes and carpet flooring.\n\nBathroom - 2.1m x 1.8m\nComprising bath with shower off, Wc, wash hand basin, partly tiled walls and tiled floor.\n\n"
      },
      {
